    "text": "montanarightnow.com\nwebsite\nTexas\nBozeman company sends trucks to aid Texas flood recovery\nBy Alex McCollum NonStop Local Multimedia Journalist,\n1 days agoBOZEMAN, Mont. – Acela Truck Company, based in Bozeman, is sending specialized trucks to Texas to assist in flood recovery efforts. The trucks, designed for high-water flood rescue, wildland firefighting and other emergency needs, are headed to Texas A&M University's Texas Task Force 1. Texas Task Force 1 team...\n91",
